+/// Program-wide probe for a `queueMicrotask(cb)` call (Task 5 / throw-fallout
+/// Stage 6). Unlike the `crypto.*`/`performance.now` probes above, the callee
+/// is a PLAIN identifier (not a member expression) — `queueMicrotask` is a
